  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The recommended concentration of fluoride ion in drinking water is up to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>ppm</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></math>as fluoride ion is required to make teeth enamel harder by converting</p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>[</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>Ca</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><msub><mi>PO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><msub><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>.</mo><mi>Ca</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>OH</mi><msub><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>]</mo></math>&nbsp;to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>[</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>Ca</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><msub><mi>PO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><msub><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>.</mo><msub><mi>CaF</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>]</mo></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>[</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>Ca</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><msub><mi>PO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><msub><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>.</mo><mi>Ca</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>OH</mi><msub><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>]</mo></math>&nbsp;+&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>[</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>Ca</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><msub><mi>PO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><msub><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>.</mo><msub><mi>CaF</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>]</mo></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/27a524cc-c9a9-40d5-8438-13ddd2f05f8b-image.png\" style=\"width: 513px; height: 102px;\" /></p></blockquote>",
